--- Single word with bold start, Exclamation Finish
*yellow!

--- Single word sentence with @* start and !. finish
@*yellow!.

--- Single word sentence with @* start and !.** finish
@*yellow!.**

--- Single propercase word sentence with @* start and !.*+*+ finish
@*Yellow!.*+*+

--- Emphasized propercase word sentence with exclamation
++Yellow!+

--- Idiomatic propercase word sentence with exclamation
/Yellow!+/

--- Aligned propercase idiomatic exclamation sentence with with + end
$$ /Yellow!+/

--- Aligned loose propercase idiomatic exclamation sentence with + end
$$    /Yellow!+/

--- Aligned smalltext h3 idiomatic propercase single word sentence  with + end
$$  _   ###  /Yellow!+/

--- Dashed word
a-b

--- Bold dashed word
*a-b*

--- Idiomatic bold dashed word
/*a-b*/

--- Variety of casings for the word "Cat"
cat CAT CaT Cat cAT cAt ccAAt

